{"input_path": "/mnt/c/Users/25840/Desktop/ocr-scan/ocr_json_app/out/peipu/pages/page01.png", "page_index": null, "page_count": null, "width": 1241, "height": 1754, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "doc_title", "block_content": "2026年上海市浦东新区华东师范大学第二附属中学高考教学质量调研", "block_bbox": [109, 163, 1129, 201], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[109.0, 163.0], [1129.0, 163.0], [1129.0, 201.0], [109.0, 201.0]]}, {"block_label": "doc_title", "block_content": "试卷（5月份）", "block_bbox": [503, 228, 720, 267], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[503.0, 228.0], [720.0, 228.0], [720.0, 267.0], [503.0, 267.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "一、单选题：本题共4小题，共18分。在每小题给出的选项中，只有一项是符合题目要求的。", "block_bbox": [106, 291, 1011, 317], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[106.0, 291.0], [1011.0, 291.0], [1011.0, 317.0], [106.0, 317.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1. 现有下表所示的一组观测数据 $ (x_i: 2, 4, 5, 6, 8; y_i: 30, 40, 60, 70, 80) $，若 $ y $与 $ x $的线性回归方程为 $ \\hat{y} = 10.5x + 5.4 $，则 $ x = 6 $对应的离差为( )\n\nA. 11.6\nB. 8.4\nC. 7.4\nD. 1.6", "block_bbox": [107, 340, 1121, 484], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[107.0, 340.0], [1121.0, 340.0], [1121.0, 484.0], [107.0, 484.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "【答案】D", "block_bbox": [117, 503, 222, 529], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[117.0, 503.0], [222.0, 503.0], [222.0, 529.0], [117.0, 529.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "【解析】解：因为y与x的线性回归方程为 $ y = 10.5x + 5.4 $，\n所以当x = 6时， $ \\hat{y} = 10.5 \\times 6 + 5.4 = 68.4 $，\n又因为x = 6对应的y的实际值为70，\n所以x = 6对应的离差为 $ y - \\hat{y} = 70 - 68.4 = 1.6 $。\n故选：D.\n利用离差的定义求解。\n本题主要考查了离差的定义，属于基础题。", "block_bbox": [105, 563, 680, 912], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[105.0, 563.0], [680.0, 563.0], [680.0, 912.0], [105.0, 912.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2. 在三棱锥中，“侧棱两两垂直且与底面成等角”是“此三棱锥为正三棱锥”的()\nA. 充分非必要条件\nB. 必要非充分条件\nC. 充要条件\nD. 既非充分也非必要条件", "block_bbox": [107, 941, 920, 1069], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[107.0, 941.0], [920.0, 941.0], [920.0, 1069.0], [107.0, 1069.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "【答案】A", "block_bbox": [118, 1088, 221, 1114], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[118.0, 1088.0], [221.0, 1088.0], [221.0, 1114.0], [118.0, 1114.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "【解析】解：过点A作AO⊥底面BCD，垂足为O，连接BO，CO，DO，∴∠ABO，∠ACO，∠ADO都是侧棱与底面所成的角，∵侧棱与底面所成的角相等，∴BO = CO = DO，侧棱AB = AC = AD，∴O是△BCD的外心，∵三条侧棱两两垂直，∴AB⊥平面ACD，∴AB⊥CD，∵AO⊥CD，∴CD⊥平面ABO，∵BOC平面ABO，∴BO⊥CD，同理CO⊥BD，∴O是△BCD的垂心，∴△BCD是正三角形，故此三棱锥为正三棱锥，充分性成立；但三棱锥为正三棱锥时，三条侧棱不一定两两垂直，必要性不成立。故选：A.", "block_bbox": [106, 1142, 775, 1600], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[106.0, 1142.0], [775.0, 1142.0], [775.0, 1600.0], [106.0, 1600.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "第1页，共19页", "block_bbox": [546, 1657, 695, 1679], "block_id": 9, "block_order": null, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[546.0, 1657.0], [694.0, 1657.0], [694.0, 1678.0], [546.0, 1678.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"input_path": null, "page_index": null, "boxes": [{"cls_id": 6, "label": "doc_title", "score": 0.9258907437324524, "coordinate": [109, 163, 1129, 201], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[109.0, 163.0], [1129.0, 163.0], [1129.0, 201.0], [109.0, 201.0]]}, {"cls_id": 6, "label": "doc_title", "score": 0.7724101543426514, "coor